lass=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>x<span>                 </span>4.838<span>    </span>0.082<span>  \r\n</span>59.089<span>    </span>0.000</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>change<span>            </span>1.685<span>    </span>0.428<span>   \r\n</span>3.938<span>    </span>0.000</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">Variances:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>change<span>            </span>1.132<span>    </span>0.131</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>x<span>                 </span>1.006<span>    </span>0.116</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; summary(cbind(predict(fit_lc), df[,3]))</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>     </span>change<span>              </span>V2<span>         </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>Min.<span>   </span>:-0.7843<span>  \r\n</span>Min.<span>   </span>:-0.7843<span>  </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>1st Qu.: 1.2256<span>   </span>1st Qu.: 1.2256<span>  </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>Median : 2.1521<span>   </span>Median : 2.1521<span>  </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>Mean<span>   </span>: 2.0148<span>  \r\n</span>Mean<span>   </span>: 2.0148<span>  </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>3rd Qu.: 2.8306<span>   </span>3rd Qu.: 2.8306<span>  </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Max.<span>   </span>: 4.2236<span>  \r\n</span>Max.<span>   </span>: 4.2236<span>  </span></span><br><br>As\r\n you can see, the estimated factor scores as well as the model itself \r\nyielded completely different solutions. Only the 0.4. version provides \r\nthe correct results...<br><br>Best, Robert"
